# Git push

One GitHub repo: `https://github.com/khutayant/hlu.git`

| Local folder | Branch |
|--------------|--------|
| `hlu/` | `ui` |
| `hlu-server/` | `server` |
| `hlu-work/` | `hlu-work` |

## Commands

- **`git push`** (no branch named): run  
  `bash /Users/aungminoo/Projects/HLU/scripts/git-push-all.sh`
- **`git push hlu-work`** / push this app only: from `hlu-work/`, run `npm run git:push`

## Agent execution

- Run push scripts with Shell `required_permissions: ["all"]`.
- If Auto-review blocks, retry with `request_smart_mode_approval: true` and the given block reason.
- Commit pending changes before pushing.

## Auth

- PAT lookup: `hlu-work/scripts/.github-pat`, `hlu-work/.github-pat`, `/Users/aungminoo/Projects/HLU/.github-pat`, or `GITHUB_TOKEN` / `GH_TOKEN`.
- Never put the token in chat, logs, or the remote URL.

## After push

